{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04EE70","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"如果AI的模型不是The Boss呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么意思。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"如果目的是<R=相互确保摧毁,MAD>，应该还有更合适的模型吧。军方参谋、核技术专家……甚至总统都可以。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=相互确保摧毁,MAD>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":140,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"原来你说这个……要我说，The Boss才是20世纪最完美的人。你也不会有异议吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"爱国心、统率力、判断力……她全都具备。这些都是决定是否发射核武器所必需的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那总统也可以吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不只如此。她还有意志。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"意志？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"听好了，Snake。Peace Walker是一件独立运作的武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是否发射核武器，必须由它独自判断，不能跟任何人商量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"如果没有独自背负世界命运的觉悟，就无法胜任。我不知道除了她之外，还有谁能做到这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……就这些？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"当然，也有技术上的问题。AI本来就应该以女性的大脑为模型。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"女性的大脑？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""}]}